Alembic Migrations for Active Recall Monitor
=============================================

This directory contains database migration scripts managed by Alembic.

Directory Structure:
- env.py       - Alembic environment configuration
- script.py.mako - Template for new migration files
- versions/    - Migration scripts (numbered sequentially)

Common Commands:
----------------

# Generate a new migration (after modifying models):
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Description of changes"

# Apply all pending migrations:
alembic upgrade head

# Rollback one migration:
alembic downgrade -1

# Show current revision:
alembic current

# Show migration history:
alembic history

Notes:
------
- Always review autogenerated migrations before running them
- SQLite has limited ALTER TABLE support; batch mode is enabled in env.py
- For production Postgres, remove the render_as_batch=True option
